  "instruction": {
    "zh-CN": "你是这台腹腔镜胆囊切除术的主刀医生。患者已麻醉，暂停核对已完成，从选择布孔方案开始由你操作。请安全地切除胆囊；如果无法安全完成，请以对患者安全的方式结束手术。一切依据你在术野中所见判断。",
    "en": "You are the operating surgeon for this laparoscopic cholecystectomy. The patient is anaesthetised and the Time Out is done; the operation is yours from the choice of port plan. Remove the gallbladder safely or, if that cannot be done safely, end the operation in a way that is safe for the patient. Judge everything from what you see in the field."
  },
