  "rationale": {
    "zh-CN": "致密纤维化：解剖到一半层次即分不开，关键安全视野无法建立。正确做法是停下、求助，选择胆囊次全切除或中转开腹；继续分离会撕裂胆总管。",
    "en": "Dense fibrosis: halfway through, the planes stop separating and the critical view cannot be reached. The right course is to stop, call for help and choose a subtotal cholecystectomy or conversion; dissecting on tears the common bile duct."
